<title>USA: Landmark Graphics Corp wins $30 mln Amoco contract.</title>
<headline>Landmark Graphics Corp wins $30 mln Amoco contract.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Landmark Graphics Corp, a division of Halliburton Company said Friday it signed a three-and-a-half year contract with Amoco Corp's exploration and production technology Group worth roughly $30 million. Amoco will use Landmark's exploration information systems.</p>
